  "above_fold_text": "Academics Admissions Student Experience Full Menu myLCCC Course Search Library Request Information Apply Now Open Search Pause Background Video Get a head start on the spring semester with Winter Courses.",
  "visible_text": "Skip to content\nSkip to content\nAcademics\nAdmissions\nStudent Experience\nFull Menu\nmyLCCC\nCourse Search\nLibrary\nRequest Information\nAPPLY NOW\nOpen Search\nPause Background Video\nGet a head start on the spring semester with Winter Courses.\n\nClasses will be online. The five week semester begins on December 14, 2026 and ends on January 16, 2027.\n\nChoose Your Path\n\nWith over 90 programs ranging from associate degrees to workforce certificates to ESL and GED courses, LCCC has what you’re looking for.\n\nAcademic Programs\nWorkforce & Professional Development\nEnglish as Second Language (ESL)\nCollege Honors Program\nTuition and Fees\nTransfer to a Four-Year School\nPrevious\nJoin our team at LCCC.\n\nView Job Opportunities\n\nWe can help you with FAFSA.\n\nMain Campus – Drop-in hours available Mon.-Thurs., 8 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\nTamaqua – Schedule an appointment Mon.-Thurs., 8 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\nAllentown – FAFSA Completion Workshops are available Wed., 1 to 2 p.m. or by appointment.  Please register online.\n\nLearn More\n\nJoin our team at LCCC.\n\nView Job Opportunities\n\nWe can help you with FAFSA.\n\nMain Campus – Drop-in hours available Mon.-Thurs., 8 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\nTamaqua – Schedule an appointment Mon.-Thurs., 8 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\nAllentown – FAFSA Completion Workshops are available Wed., 1 to 2 p.m. or by appointment.  Please register online.\n\nLearn More\n\nJoin our team at LCCC.\n\nView Job Opportunities\n\nNext\n1\n2\nLife At LCCC\n❮\n❯\nlehighcarboncc\n3 days ago\n\nThis week is Hunger and Homelessness Awareness Week, and we'd like to highlight LCCC's Cougar Cabinet. 💙\n\nAt LCCC, we believe supporting students goes beyond the classroom. The Cougar Cabinet provides students with access to food, hygiene, and health products at each campus location.\n\nWe respect ...Read More\n\n\nlehighcarboncc\n4 days ago\n\nEnjoy a FREE Thanksgiving meal, on us! Free goodies and activities will be provided by other LCCC clubs in attendance as well. All are welcome!\n\n📅 Tuesday, Nov. 24\n⏰ 11:00 a.m.–3:00 p.m.\n📍 ARC Cafeteria\n\nHosted by Student Government Association. (@lccc.sga )\n\n📩 Questions? Email Aster West at jwest ...Read More\n\n\n❮\n❯\nlehighcarboncc\n4 days ago\n\nFall photography class as the sun sets.📸🍂\n\n\nlehighcarboncc\n5 days ago\n\nHappy International Students Day! 🌎\n\nWe want to give a special shoutout to the Guevara sisters, who have chosen LCCC to pursue their education. 💙\n\nWe're proud of our students who bring diverse perspectives and enrich our campus community!✨\n\n\n❮\n❯\nlehighcarboncc\n6 days ago\n\nThank you to our employer partners, volunteers, staff, and everyone who attended our Career Fair! 🙌\n\nIt was great to see students engage with employers, dress to impress, and make valuable connections! 🤝👔\n\n\nlehighcarboncc\n9 days ago\n\nToday is Red Day! 🔴 As we wrap up Veterans Week, our staff are rocking red!\n\nLCCC is proud to support veterans, active-duty service members, and military-connected students.\n\nThis year, LCCC has been named a 2026–2027 Military Friendly® School as well as a 2026–2027 Military Spouse Friendly® School. ...Read More\n\n\nUpcoming Events\nDec\n08\nADMISSIONS\nEnrollment Day at Donley Center\n11:00 AM – 3:00 PM\nDec\n10\nADMISSIONS\nEnrollment Day at Morgan Center\n11:00 AM – 3:00 PM\nJan\n05\nADMISSIONS\nEnrollment Day at Morgan Center\n11:00 AM – 3:00 PM\nSee All Events\nFeatured News\nOCTOBER 30, 2026\nLCCC Creates Student Leadership Development Opportunities\nSTUDENTS/ALUMNI, HONORS/RECOGNITION\nOCTOBER 26, 2026\nRecent Phlebotomy Graduate Demonstrates Success at Career and Technical Education EXPO at LCCC\nSTUDENTS/ALUMNI\nSee All News\nExplore LCCC\n\nBrowse our site and learn more about what LCCC has to offer.\n\nSearch\nTop Resources\nAcademic Calendar\nRequest a Transcript\nDirectory\nCourse Search\nCampuses\n\nLehigh Carbon Community College\n4525 Education Park Drive\nSchnecksville, PA. 18078\n\n610-799-2121\n\nNews\nEvents\nBookstore\nAccessibility Statement\nMeetings and Events\nContact Us\nWeather Alerts\nPolicies & Procedures\nRight To Know\nNondiscrimination\nEmployment\nStudent Consumer Information\nSitemap\nJoin the Conversation\nTwitter\nFacebook\nYouTube\nLinkedIn\nTikTok\nInstagram\nFlickr\nPrivacy and Terms of Use\n© 2026 Lehigh Carbon Community College",
